    "reason": "T-001 host probe (2026-10-25, Claude Code 2.1.302, Windows): Claude keeps the plugin $.store file <config>/plugins/store/agdf_agdf-<hash>.json after `claude plugin uninstall`, so SDD-07 cannot meet AC-009 / SCN-017; the approved TP and SD route this block back to SD.",
    "intended_change": "Persist the three companion choices (enabled, still, per-project selection) in one JSON file inside the AGDF plugin data directory <config dir>/plugins/data/agdf-agdf/, derived from CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR or the user profile and written only when that directory already exists, otherwise keep them for the session only; never use $.store. Align TP T-004, SCN-001 and SCN-017 and renew the failure-variant dispatch evidence.",
